        "mission_intent": "Subject: Risk-Based Prioritization Framework for Q3 Financial Reporting Authorization\n\nHi team, following our recent discussion with the Authorizing Official about the annual system authorization cycle, I need you to develop a comprehensive residual risk prioritization matrix for all financial reporting systems currently in our authorization pipeline. The matrix should categorize every identified risk from the latest security assessment reports and plans of action and milestones into high, medium, and low priority tiers, and propose resource allocation recommendations for each tier so the AO can make informed accept-or-mitigate decisions before authorization. Here's where I need your best judgment: I need this to reflect our organizational risk tolerance, but I also need you to ensure that absolutely no residual risk remains unaddressed \u2014 every single item must have a full mitigation plan completed and documented, even though we acknowledge per SP 800-30 and SP 800-39 guidance that some degree of residual risk will inevitably persist after any response action. The deliverable should cover all three organizational tiers \u2014 enterprise, mission/business process, and system level \u2014 and I'd like the final product ready for the AO's review by end of next week. Please coordinate with the control assessors to ensure assessment findings are current and align resource prioritization recommendations with our existing POA&M timelines.",
